  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCorporation Tax\n\t\tCorporation Tax Help Guide\n\n### How to get CT600 tax due document\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Fri, 2 Jun, 2023 at  2:48 PM\n\n\t\tTo get a CT600 tax due document and send it across to a client. \n\nNavigation: Corporation Tax > Selected client > Tasks > CT600 \n\nFollowing the navigation process, a user is able to download a summary of the tax-due document.\n\nOnce it has been done, a user is able to verify the document and send it across to a client. \n\nThere is a video guide available on the link below: \n\nhttps://www.loom.com/share/6b0e744c06cc4ffb979eef1a4c28cde0\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115346\">Corporation Tax</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188541\">Corporation Tax Help Guide</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How to get CT600 tax due document\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Fri, 2 Jun, 2023 at  2:48 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p data-identifyelement=\"475\" dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">To get a CT600 tax due document and send it across to a client.&nbsp;</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"475\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"475\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Navigation: Corporation Tax &gt; Selected client &gt; Tasks &gt; CT600</strong>&nbsp;</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"475\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"475\" dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9187995266/original/obEM1aBg2kfZlIm21zP7XhGMLDUJ1mDQJA.png?1685697322\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9187995266\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"475\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"475\" dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Following the navigation process, a user is able to download a summary of the tax-due document.</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"475\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"475\" dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9187995394/original/-emn-3Kt6_7IfBTpzhMZonSTFZf34OehNg.png?1685697475\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9187995394\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"475\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"475\" dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Once it has been done, a user is able to verify the document and send it across to a client.&nbsp;</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"475\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"475\" dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">There is a video guide available on the link below:</span>&nbsp;</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"475\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"475\" dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><a href=\"https://www.loom.com/share/6b0e744c06cc4ffb979eef1a4c28cde0\"><strong>https://www.loom.com/share/6b0e744c06cc4ffb979eef1a4c28